# andronix install debian --de xfce: the steps, then the first-login questions.
# The package steps take about two minutes in the recording box; they run
# hidden (Hide/Show), so the demo cuts from the first steps to the finished
# list. Fixed Sleeps, not Wait: VHS's Wait doesn't match the question forms.
Output out/install.webm
Output out/install.mp4
Output out/install.gif
Source settings.tape

Type "andronix install debian --de xfce"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
Hide
Sleep 170s
Show
Sleep 2.5s
Type "user"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "demo1234"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "demo1234"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 4s
